 about our operational workflow, features, and precision engineering.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"__variable_7fd790 __variable_6b03d3 __variable_a11773 __variable_cd006a __variable_c22fe1 __variable_472ac2 __variable_c70c06 __className_7fd790 antialiased overflow-x-hidden bg-[#001C2F]\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\"></section><nav class=\"h-[70px] flex items-center fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 bg-transparent\"><div class=\"container mx-auto w-full px-4 flex justify-between items-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><a href=\"/\"><img alt=\"All Service Rental\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/icons/logo1.svg\"/></a></div><div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-9\"><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-medium transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/equipment\">Equipment</a><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-medium transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/how-it-works\">How it Works</a><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-medium transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-medium transition-colors text-sm\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><a href=\"/login\"><button class=\"bg-secondary hover:bg-secondary/90 text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-8 rounded-[10px] text-sm transition-all active:scale-95 shadow-lg\">Login</button></a><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-bold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/welcome\">Sign Up</a></div></div><div class=\"lg:hidden\"><button class=\"text-white p-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"flex-grow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full font-manrope\"><section class=\"relative bg-[#011428] h-[550px] w-full flex items-center overflow-hidden selection:bg-green-500/30 pt-[120px] pb-20 lg:pt-0 lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"absolute -right-20 lg:right-[5%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[300px] h-[300px] lg:w-[500px] lg:h-[500px] pointer-events-none opacity-20 lg:opacity-40 transition-all duration-700\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-full\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 border border-[#66DF7520] rotate-[30deg] scale-110\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 border border-[#66DF7530] rotate-45 scale-[0.85]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-[35%] border border-[#66DF7530] rotate-45 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 lg:w-16 lg:h-16 -rotate-45 flex items-center justify-center\"><img alt=\"Workflow Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain opacity-90\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/Work5.svg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl\"><div class=\"w-fit flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-wider font-[700] text-[#66DF75] text-[14px] tracking-[0.2em] text-[#66DF75] mb-8\">Protocol 01: Operational Workflow</div><h1 class=\"text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-bold mb-10 lg:whitespace-nowrap uppercase !text-[60px] md:!text-[70px] !font-bold !tracking-tight !leading-[0.95] !font-afacad\"><span class=\"text-blue-100\">Frictionless</span> <span class=\"text-[#66DF75]\">Velocity.</span></h1><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-base md:text-2xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-light\">Experience the kinetic power of a logistics infrastructure built for the next century. Our automated rental protocol ensures your cargo never stops moving.</p></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_70%_50%,_rgba(102,223,117,0.05),transparent_50%)]\"></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#081D30] text-white py-16 md:py-24 px-4 selection:bg-green-500/30\"><div class=\"container mx-auto space-y-24 md:space-y-40\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 lg:gap-32\"><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-6\"><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"text-4xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-[#66DF75] absolute -top-6 -left-2 md:-left-4 pointer-events-none select-none opacity-10\">01</span><h2 class=\"text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-bold relative z-10\">Identity Protocol</h2></div><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-lg font-light\">Secure your position in the All Service Rental network. Our biometric-grade onboarding verifies your operational credentials in milliseconds, granting instant access to the fleet.</p><div class=\"w-fit flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-wider font-[700] text-[#66DF75] text-[14px] tracking-[0.2em] pt-4 with-line\"><div class=\"w-12 h-[2px] bg-[#66DF75]\"></div>SECURITY CLEARANCE LEVEL 41</div></div><div class=\"flex-1 w-full\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-white/5 group\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-[url(&#x27;https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/carbon-fibre.png&#x27;)] opacity-10 pointer-events-none\"></div><img alt=\"Identity Protocol\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110 opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork1.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork1.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork1.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork1.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork1.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork1.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork1.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-20 pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"relative w-12 h-12 md:w-16 md:h-16 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"><img alt=\"Identity Protocol icon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain filter drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,197,94,0.4)]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/Work1.svg\"/></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 shadow-[inset_0_0_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] pointer-events-none z-30\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-16 lg:gap-32\"><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-6\"><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"text-4xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-[#66DF75] absolute -top-6 -left-2 md:-left-4 pointer-events-none select-none opacity-10\">02</span><h2 class=\"text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-bold relative z-10\">Global Network Capacity</h2></div><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-lg font-light\">Browse our monolithic fleet of autonomous vessels, heavy-lift aircraft, and hyper-rail modules. Real-time availability across 142 global hubs.</p><div class=\"space-y-4 pt-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] tracking-widest text-slate-200 font-bold group\"><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-2 border-[#66DF75] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 text-[#66DF75]\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"6\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg></div>REAL-TIME ASSET TELEMETRY</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] tracking-widest text-slate-200 font-bold group\"><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-2 border-[#66DF75] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 text-[#66DF75]\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"6\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg></div>DYNAMIC CAPACITY FORECASTING</div></div></div><div class=\"flex-1 w-full\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-white/5 group\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-[url(&#x27;https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/carbon-fibre.png&#x27;)] opacity-10 pointer-events-none\"></div><img alt=\"Global Network Capacity\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110 opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork2.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork2.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork2.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork2.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork2.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-20 pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"relative w-12 h-12 md:w-16 md:h-16 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"><img alt=\"Global Network Capacity icon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain filter drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,197,94,0.4)]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/work2.svg\"/></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 shadow-[inset_0_0_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] pointer-events-none z-30\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 lg:gap-32\"><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-6\"><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"text-4xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-[#66DF75] absolute -top-6 -left-2 md:-left-4 pointer-events-none select-none opacity-10\">03</span><h2 class=\"text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-bold relative z-10\">Kinetic Pricing</h2></div><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-lg font-light\">Eliminate negotiations. Our algorithmic engine calculates pricing based on mass, velocity, and global demand spikes, providing a binding quote in under 2 seconds.</p><div class=\"bg-slate-900/50 border-l-2 border-green-500 p-5 max-w-sm rounded-r-sm mt-8\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\"><span class=\"text-green-500 text-[10px] md:text-xs font-bold tracking-tighter\">ESTIMATED DELTA:</span><span class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl text-green-500 font-black\">-14%</span></div><p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold tracking-widest mt-1 uppercase\">COST EFFICIENCY VS. INDUSTRY BASELINE</p></div></div><div class=\"flex-1 w-full\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-white/5 group\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-[url(&#x27;https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/carbon-fibre.png&#x27;)] opacity-10 pointer-events-none\"></div><img alt=\"Kinetic Pricing\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110 opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork3.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork3.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork3.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork3.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork3.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork3.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork3.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork3.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork3.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-20 pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"relative w-12 h-12 md:w-16 md:h-16 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"><img alt=\"Kinetic Pricing icon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain filter drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,197,94,0.4)]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/Work3.svg\"/></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 shadow-[inset_0_0_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] pointer-events-none z-30\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-16 lg:gap-32\"><div class=\"flex-1 space-y-6\"><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"text-4xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-[#66DF75] absolute -top-6 -left-2 md:-left-4 pointer-events-none select-none opacity-10\">04</span><h2 class=\"text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-bold relative z-10\">Total Command Center</h2></div><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-lg font-light\">The Monolith at your fingertips. Manage your global deployments, reroute assets on the fly, and receive AI-driven disruption alerts from a single glass interface.</p><button class=\"font-[700] uppercase tracking-wider transition-all rounded-[16px] flex items-center justify-center gap-3 active:scale-95 border border-[#28A745] text-[#28A745] hover:bg-[#28A745] hover:text-white px-6 py-2.5 text-[12px] mt-8 !text-white !bg-transparent flex items-center justify-center feature-btn-outline !border-[#8794844D] hover:!bg-white/10 hover:!text-white\">VIEW INTERFACE SPECS</button></div><div class=\"flex-1 w-full\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-white/5 group\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-[url(&#x27;https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/carbon-fibre.png&#x27;)] opacity-10 pointer-events-none\"></div><img alt=\"Total Command Center\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110 opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork4.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork4.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork4.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork4.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork4.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork4.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork4.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork4.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork4.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-20 pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"relative w-12 h-12 md:w-16 md:h-16 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110\"><img alt=\"Total Command Center icon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain filter drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(34,197,94,0.4)]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/Work4.svg\"/></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 shadow-[inset_0_0_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] pointer-events-none z-30\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative bg-[#011428] text-white py-16 md:py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"><img alt=\"Technical Background\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-[0.06]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork5.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork5.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork5.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork5.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork5.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork5.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork5.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork5.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwork5.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#011428]/80 via-transparent to-[#011428]/80\"></div></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10\"><div class=\"mb-12 md:mb-20 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-bold \">Precision Engineering<span class=\"text-[#66DF75]\">.</span></h2><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-light\">The technical backbone of the All Service Rental ecosystem.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div><div class=\"bg-[#182B40] p-6 md:p-8 rounded-sm text-left border border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-between w-full max-w-[324px] min-h-[220px] md:min-h-[260px] mx-auto group transition-all hover:bg-[#1d334a] hover:-translate-y-1 \"><div><h3 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#66DF75] tracking-tighter mb-3 md:mb-4 group-hover:drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(102,223,117,0.3)] transition-all\">99.9%</h3><h4 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2\">System Uptime</h4><p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-light text-sm md:text-base\">Redundant planetary servers ensuring zero operational blackout windows.</p></div></div></div><div><div class=\"bg-[#182B40] p-6 md:p-8 rounded-sm text-left border border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-between w-full max-w-[324px] min-h-[220px] md:min-h-[260px] mx-auto group transition-all hover:bg-[#1d334a] hover:-translate-y-1 \"><div><h3 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#66DF75] tracking-tighter mb-3 md:mb-4 group-hover:drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(102,223,117,0.3)] transition-all\">14ms</h3><h4 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2\">API Latency</h4><p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-light text-sm md:text-base\">Near-instantaneous command execution across the global mesh network.</p></div></div></div><div><div class=\"bg-[#182B40] p-6 md:p-8 rounded-sm text-left border border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-between w-full max-w-[324px] min-h-[220px] md:min-h-[260px] mx-auto group transition-all hover:bg-[#1d334a] hover:-translate-y-1 \"><div><h3 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#66DF75] tracking-tighter mb-3 md:mb-4 group-hover:drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(102,223,117,0.3)] transition-all\">Zero</h3><h4 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2\">Human Friction</h4><p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-light text-sm md:text-base\">Fully automated booking pipeline eliminates administrative bottlenecks.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><se